    "body": "Merged `main` at 3f41b8da6 into this branch.\n\n- Files resolved by hand: none. The merge had no conflicts.\n- After the merge, two tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/wcs_page_picks.rs` failed: the pointer press on \"Pick for WCS\" did not arm the row. The AccessKit click armed it, so the row code is correct. The press came before the hit test of egui knew the row. Commit 79b256d8b adds the helper `press_pick`: the pointer stays on the button for one frame, then presses. No product code changed.\n- Gate on head 79b256d8b (`cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`), 9 steps, 0 failed:\n  - ui lib: 1004 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored.\n  - boundary, boundary_picks, sinker_setup, tap_hand, theme_example, theme_files, waterjet_tool: pass.\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- The PR stays a draft.\n\nReady for a re-check.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
